1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,210
The money gave Dufraisne the opportunity

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:05,800
to discover who'd stolen
the Red Mercury from Iceland.

3
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:11,580
Then he got himself a sample
to use both as a test and a diversion.

4
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:14,370
He had the sample shipped to Cozumel.

5
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,160
We followed soon after.

6
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:21,040
The target was a cruise ship
with 2,000 souls on board.

7
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:24,980
Dufraisne wanted us to plant
the Red Mercury bomb and get out.

8
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:28,170
Lambert wanted me to prevent
the detonation by tampering

9
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,200
with its trigger mechanism,
Enrica's cell phone.

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:36,020
But you interfered
and made everything worse.

11
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,960
I couldn't rely on you, Fisher.

12
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,920
The stakes were too high.
